of their business.

00:37:40.350 --> 00:37:42.920
It's not only honing
their craft and their art,

00:37:42.920 --> 00:37:45.680
but it's also really effectively
running their business.

00:37:45.680 --> 00:37:47.300
So they're in the back.

00:37:47.300 --> 00:37:51.410
They're actually the ones in
the kitchens creating the goods.

00:37:51.410 --> 00:37:54.980
They are then moving over,
washing up, and going over

00:37:54.980 --> 00:37:59.240
to their laptops, and calling
up vendors, tracking orders,

00:37:59.240 --> 00:38:03.750
bill payments, and then also
handling customer service.

00:38:03.750 --> 00:38:06.280
They're also looking
up new recipes,

00:38:06.280 --> 00:38:07.280
