00:38:07.280 --> 00:38:09.380
They're trying to
find out, how do

00:38:09.380 --> 00:38:12.630
I get inspired to build
what I love doing?

00:38:12.630 --> 00:38:15.530
So with that in mind, we
created a demo to see,

00:38:15.530 --> 00:38:18.050
