this experience for them

00:38:18.050 --> 00:38:20.120
so they're not running
around everywhere?

00:38:20.120 --> 00:38:24.030
And it really creates a
seamless interaction with them.

00:38:24.030 --> 00:38:25.325
So with that in mind--

00:38:30.100 --> 00:38:31.970
